      "writtenOn": "2020-12-11T06:40:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why ? If we do that, I think we should do the same with the portal URL and isCaptive, but passpoint doesn\u0027t seem to have a way to update them over time.\nI think in the most common case we don\u0027t expect both to be set or different anyway; is it a problem to keep this consistent with other attributes ?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 6154,
        "startChar": 11,
        "endLine": 6154,
        "endChar": 70
      },
      "revId": "c3c57b39e8f603ead980c9da97d1fd8b553a3ba4",
